I already add two external drive on an PWS433au which has two
internal disk.
To correctly add the disks, You should :
- add an active terminal SE to the end of the external SCSI bus.
- The total length bus must not exceed 1.5meter (because the
length of internal bus is added to the external bus).

My external disks are an IBM ultra2LVD 36Go and  an quantum
8Go. My firmware is v5.7.

You should check on the qlogic website and find a document on
the QLA1xxx installation .

Mickael,



