Probably the other way around, "ISA-".  The problem was a bug in the ISA bus
code that only copied 4 bytes from the device ID, instead of all 8 bytes (up
to the trailing null if present).

The problem was in V7.1, but was fixed in later revisions.  A flag in the
configuration data to the effect of ISA_4BYTEONLY, or some such thing, was
needed to deal with it.

_Fred

