A BREAK is more or less exactly what happens on the line
when you power-cycle a terminal. So your VAXstation
believes it has seen the result of you pressing BREAK
on the terminal.

In alternate console mode, I don't believe that there
is any way of modifying this behaviour on a VAXstation.

